This package imports github.com/imksoo/routerd/pkg/pdclient from the pinned
module at commit 1329ef54f296507eda79bbbc3b853783dd27251e. The upstream protocol
engine is BSD-3-Clause licensed. Its copyright/license is retained in the module
distribution. The routerd2 native socket, persistence, validation and effects
adapter is new code and does not execute the upstream standalone daemon.

Transport behavior was checked against cmd/routerd-dhcpv6-client/main.go at
that same commit. The adapter adds interface binding, retransmission handling
for Request, elapsed-time, DUID/IAID validation and explicit effect withdrawal.
